WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.160
In order to keep this city peaceful,
my magic can't become any weaker than it is right now.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.580
MUCK
MUCK

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.580
But... I've done a really poor job of that already.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.120
My sister used to love the sweets from that shop.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.870
Well, you know that
Magical Girls sometimes dematerialize

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.700
if they use up too much of their magic, right?

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.700
We have to be sure not to put any more strain on her.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.250
Ancestor, I'm thinking about trying to get Momo
to open her heart to me.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.160
Oh?

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.120
I'll get closer to her until she finally drops her guard,

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.580
and then seek out the info I need
to compete with her as an equal.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:32.200
I got the idea from Ryo.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.700
Wonderful, Shamiko! You've finally learned
how to think things through.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.790
So, what exactly is your plan for getting closer to Momo?

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:41.160
Make a delicious lunch to give her every single day.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:45.290
Thank you, Shamiko! I'm really weak to any attacks
on the bone that's just out of the elbow.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:46.370
Just like that.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:48.000
Oh jeez, I take back what I said.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.620
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:05.580
Taiyou mabushisugite

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:08.410
(Chikachika me o kosutta)

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:11.330
Omowazu tobidashita yo

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:13.870
(Dokidoki no hajimiari sa)

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:19.620
Yurayura yureru maegami hidarite de osaetara

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:24.200
Itsumo no keshiki ga kirameku yo

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:25.410
(Three, two, one)

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:30.450
Ima sugu tsutaetai futari no himitsu

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:36.950
Watashitachi nara dekiru yo

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:36.950
(Itsumo tonari ni ite)

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:38.950
Kitto

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.620
(Shijiteru kara)

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:45.620
Machikado de mitsuketa daiji na takaramono

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:51.410
Tatoe kimi ga tooku hanaretemo kanarazu oikakeru yo

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:57.500
Zutto kagayaiteru mirai wa koko ni aru

00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:02.700
Otanoshimi wa kore kara

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Diving into Dreams Once Again!!
Break Through the Pink Defense Line

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:26.660
Hmm... How can I get Momo to open her heart?

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:29.200
Listen, Shamiko. You don't have to use
such roundabout methods to get things done.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:30.830
You have the perfect ability for times like these, no?

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:33.660
Don't forget you're a descendant
of the great succubus Lilith, dominator of dreams!

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:37.080
All you have to do is dive into Momo's dream
and then implant her with deep affection for you!

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:38.540
Deep affection...

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:40.830
While you're at it, implant her
with a proper sense of respect for me, too!

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:44.450
That girl is always so insolent when it comes to me!
Not to mention that air of superiority she gives off!

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:47.410
If you could make her reflexively drop on all fours
whenever she sees me, that would be great.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:48.870
I would hate having a Momo like that!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:53.330
And make sure to implant the idea that she should make
3 spare bodies for me to inhabit every day.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:55.330
I would also enjoy it if you could....

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:55.330
LILITH'S JOURNAL
OF FRUSTRATING
EXPERIENCES

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:59.410
COLA
COLA
COLA

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:57.410
...force her to dance and groove to the rhythm!

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.410
The world doesn't revolve around you, Ancestor.

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:01.540
But isn't doing that kind of like cheating?

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:02.950
We're at war, Shamiko.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:07.830
You'll just be disrespecting your opponent if you
don't charge at them with everything in your arsenal.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:08.580
But...

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:11.910
COLA

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:11.910
Let me guess, you were just putting on a show
with all that tough talk earlier.

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:15.580
The truth is that you're just sulking
because Momo already knows your secrets.

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:16.910
Heh-heh-heh... Heh-heh-heh!

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.120
That's not true!

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:21.330
There's no reason for you to be so interested
in discovering her true feelings otherwise.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:24.290
That's not the case AT ALL!

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:27.370
Fine then! I'll play dirty if that's what it takes!

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:28.830
Excellent! That's the spirit!

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:31.000
Now then, let's hurry and get you to sleep.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.870
I'll act as your support once you start dreaming.

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:40.080
The last time that I dived into Momo's dream,
it ended up being a huge hassle.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.830
Is it going to be the same this time?

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:46.000
Diving into the dream of someone you've already
connected to before is easy, it's a straight shot!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.500
Your magic has also been slowly growing as of late.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.870
That's made it easier for me to connect with you, too.
But just in case...

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:55.450
Canned Peaches

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:55.450
...you should leave some pictures of her by your pillow
to create a stronger connection to her channel.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:56.660
This is too weird!

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:59.700
You give careful thought to your subordinates
even in your sleep, huh, Sis?

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:01.160
Don't you dare take any pictures!

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.910
Huh? Where am I?

00:04:08.910 --> 00:04:10.410
Hey, Shamiko.

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.120
Ancestor?

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.540
You've reached the outer-most region
of Momo's subconscious.

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:17.120
The outer-most region?

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:21.700
I'm certain that she has some sort of guard
built around her heart, so go smash it to pieces!

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:25.160
Smash it? But I haven't brought
any tools or weapons with me.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.040
Listen, you're a succubus.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.910
As a demon of dreams, you can conjure up
whatever weapons you want!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.870
Any weapon I want, huh?

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.660
I think you can make more creative choices than those...

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.540
This sucks, I was able to go
straight to the center of her dream last time.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:44.080
The ease of which you can enter dreams
depends on the physical state of your prey.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:47.040
Momo is probably in better condition
than the last time you came.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:50.410
Why would she be in better condition than before?

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:54.580
1 Head of cabbage
per person

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.330
Oh! It was me!

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.580
I was giving my mortal enemy nutrients
that made her stronger!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:57.660
I want to conserve as much of your magic as possible,
so I'm cutting our connection.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:05:00.160
Oh crap! I screwed up! Gah!

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:00.160
If you get into a pinch,
feel free to rely on the Ancestor Telephone.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.660
"Ancestor Telephone"?

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:03.500
Anyway, I wish you the best of luck!

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:04.200
Huh?

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:06.080
Ancestor...

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:11.410
I guess all I can do now is look for the entrance...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:13.370
Who art thou?

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.700
A-a cat-man?!

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.120
Wait, is that you Metako?

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:21.040
Oh, and it looks like there's an entrance behind you.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.910
Nay, I am not Metatron.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:26.910
I am naught but one of the 365,000 eyes of Metatron.

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:31.200
I stand watch over pure souls of the Light Clan priests
and assure no vermin defile them with their filth.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.910
I am one of the angelic order!

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:37.290
Just looking at him is so overwhelming
that my brain can't even process what he's saying.

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.910
Oh, he stopped glowing.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:42.700
Metako, I want to get inside of Momo's heart.
Please let me in.

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.870
Deliberating.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.040
I am uncertain.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:53.950
Thou doth emit an aura of darkness, however I also
sense a trace of my former master, Sakura Chiyoda.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.370
"Sakura Chiyoda"?

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.120
Who art thou?

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.080
What is thy purpose here?

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.790
I am Momo's mortal enemy!

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.950
My plan today is to invade her heart
and then go from there!

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:05.870
Exterminate!

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:08.250
It was worth a try! Crisis Management!

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:34.830
Oh, that's right! I should be able
to conjure up some weapons in here!

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.410
Um, something strong... I need something strong!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.910
Okay, how about one of those pistols I saw
in that movie recently?

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:43.660
Wait, what was the trigger supposed to look like again?

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:46.750
Maybe a missile...
but what are those actually made out of?

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.450
Crap, my mind can't help
but imagine a daikon radish instead!

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:53.370
My imagination is so terrible
I can't conjure up anything useful!

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.160
Whatever, anything will help at this point!

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:04.410
Something that left an impact on me recently which
seems strong, tough and has a really simple shape!

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:06.830
I summon you! New Ancestor!

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:11.620
Scuttle, scuttle, scuttle...

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:12.950
Hm? That looks like...

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:15.450
...a delicious bug!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:22.700
That takes care of that problem but... what the heck...?

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:25.370
I ended up creating a really surreal dream.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:28.540
I finally made it to the entrance.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:28.910
GACHUNK

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.200
Huh?

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:32.870
It won't open. But why?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:36.160
Grr
Grr
Grr
Grr

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:37.500
Oh, I know!

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.080
There's a number lock!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:41.040
"Live Chicks n' Jive Tricks Wahoo."

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.540
I'm one of those brainy demons!

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:42.950
BUZZ

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.200
Huh?

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:45.200
BUZZ

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:46.450
BUZZ

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:48.830
Fine, I'll just force my way in
with the closest thing to a weapon I can get!

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.330
Take THIIIIIIS!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:51.830
SNAP!!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.160
What do I do now?

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.700
This door might be made so that
a Demon like me could never open it.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:09.080
If I knew I would end up feeling this hopeless,
I should have tried harder in the real world instead.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.200
I'm not going to give up just yet.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:19.450
I summon you! Lunch box!

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.500
Momo? I brought you some food.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.080
Please let me in!

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:26.950
Pretty please!

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:33.580
Shamiko?

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.000
Momo!

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.660
Come on in.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.250
You don't have to tell me twice!

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:40.580
The Momo that exists in her dream
is welcoming me inside!

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:44.120
What a relief... thank you, Momo...
I was scared, so scared...

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:45.250
I wasn't sure what to do!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.040
Right.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.950
I was so worried that I couldn't
open the door no matter what I tried.

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:49.790
I see.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:52.290
But that puts an end to my suffering for today!

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:54.250
Now I can launch my campaign
to implant your head with-

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.620
Nope. What's about to happen
is you getting a harsh scolding.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:01.370
I can tell you're the real Shamiko and not just
a figment of my dream. What's going on?

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:02.950
Huh? This isn't like the last time I was here!

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.950
Um... well, you see...

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:07.120
Oh! Now's a good time to use the Ancestor Telephone!

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.750
I'm in trouble, Ancestor! What's going on?!

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:13.580
I've got bad news, Shamiko. It seems that Momo's
consciousness has awakened within the dream.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:14.790
What the heck does that mean?!

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.580
It's what they call a lucid dream.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.700
The Momo inside of this dream
is now aware that she's dreaming.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:23.790
And she's got a tight hold on your tail right now,
which means you can't make a break for it.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.750
Then... what do I do?

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.950
It's a raw deal, but I'm stuck behind my seal
so I can't help you.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:31.500
Oh, the magic we use to talk is about to run out!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.910
I'm rooting for you, Shamiko!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:36.000
Ancestor!

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.410
Cola is the best!

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:41.290
Let's have a chat while we eat the food you brought.

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.500
Lunch box!

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:53.620
AWKWARD   AWKWARD   AWKWARD

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:47.410
When did you figure it all out?

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:53.410
I was watching Metako chomping down on a Shamicen
with long legs, when I realized that this was all a dream.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:56.450
The dream Ancestor I conjured up got eaten in the end...

00:09:56.450 --> 00:10:00.250
I was just about to wake up
when I heard you shouting, so I went to take a look.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:07.450
D-don't think this means you've won.

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:08.290
Bye.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.080
You can't go until you've answered all of my questions.

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:11.910
Huh?

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:15.080
Oh, there's only one pair of chopsticks here.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:19.120
Please let me out of here!

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:21.660
Shamiko, can you conjure up another pair of chopsticks?

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:25.580
Ancestooooor!

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:26.870
Don't give up, Shamiko! Next time, make sure
to review the things you want to conjure before you go!

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:40.000
Within Momo's Dream

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:40.000
So, you can dive into
and manipulate other people's dreams?

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:43.160
I can't believe you never mentioned having such
an incredibly powerful ability like that.

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:45.200
Now Momo knows about
my one and only secret weapon.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:48.120
Is my ability really all that incredible? Isn't it kind of dull?

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.000
It's very powerful!

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.370
The fact you haven't realized how dangerous it can be
means that you really have no combat sense at all!

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:56.370
I can come up with 100 or 200 different ways
to abuse that power for evil, easily!

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:58.160
But aren't you supposed to be a heroic Magical Girl?!

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:00.870
By the way, which of those methods
did you think would work the best?

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:02.660
I won't tell you, because it'll be a bad influence!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.000
Oh?

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:09.500
You really aren't suited to being a fighter, Shamiko.

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.580
Why do you keep pushing yourself to fight despite that?

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.160
I'm not pushing myself!

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:16.450
I'm really not.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:20.450
I... When I was young...

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:23.910
...my body was really weak
and I was always in the hospital.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:27.450
Even after I was discharged,
they told me I shouldn't run or exert myself.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.330
That and my eyesight was terri-

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.950
You weren't supposed to run?!

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:34.120
But I've forced you to run quite a lot, haven't I?

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:38.330
I would be upset if you held back on my account,
and I've actually been healthy ever since I grew horns.

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:40.120
Are you really that stupid, Shamiko?!

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:42.200
Why wouldn't you tell me something
so important about yourself?!

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.830
Well you've been keeping
plenty of secrets of your own, Momo!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:45.790
Huh?

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.500
Mikan told me all about it.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:49.910
She said that Magical Girls
who lose their magic can disappear.

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:53.450
Uh, I just didn't think that was worth mentioning.

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:56.410
Does that mean you only think of me
as an insignificant filler villain?

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:57.700
You've got the wrong idea!

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:00.910
I really want to beat you,
but I don't want you to disappear if I do!

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.700
Then I'm only more confused about
why you're so persistent about fighting me!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.700
Didn't you want to undo the seal upon your family?

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.500
That's neither here nor there!

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:10.410
I'm not giving up on the seal,
but I'm going to find another way to handle it!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.500
I want to undo the seal.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:14.290
My mom won't admit to it,

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:18.290
but I think my father is unable to come home because
he's working to pay off the debt from my treatment!

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:20.750
That's why I have to do everything I can!

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.500
Your father is working away from home?

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.040
Do you know exactly where he went?

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.330
Yeah, according to my mom...

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:29.500
Until recently, your father was a squid fisherman
on a nuclear-powered submersible aircraft carrier,

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:32.950
and now he's a crewmember responsible
for buying air purifiers onboard a space battleship!

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:34.080
Amazing!

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:36.250
Squid fishing usually happens at night...

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:38.080
But wait, that's not the real problem here...

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:41.250
Huh? Momo, are you getting worn out?

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:41.250
Somehow that managed to give me a headache
inside of my own dream.

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:43.450
Your lack of knowledge
is just too overwhelming, Shamiko.

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:46.250
I'm starting to understand that you were raised
by a very protective family.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.950
Remember the piece of paper
that was taped onto your front door?

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:52.910
That's a barrier designed to protect Demons
from being hunted by Magical Girls.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.000
Protect them from being hunted?

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:59.790
Being a Magical Girl works on a point-based system.
The more Demons we hunt, the greater return we get.

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:03.580
Although these days, there aren't many of us
who hunt so incessantly.

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:04.200
So, you mean...

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:09.410
ALL BATTLES ARE
MADE BY APPPOINTMENT
NO RAIDS
-THE DEMONS

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:07.750
...that paper on our door has the same impact
as those "No Soliciting" signs meant for salesmen!

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:09.410
That's not quite right! Actually, you're way off base!

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:12.410
Do you know who made that barrier, Shamiko?

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:17.330
The fact that paper is on your door probably means that
your mother is hiding something important, Shamiko.

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:19.500
Huh? But my mother isn't a bad person!

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:22.540
She's always so nice
and has suffered so much because of me...

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:25.200
Right, but there's still something strange going on.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:28.790
I'm sorry to say it, but I also think she lied about
your father being away from home for work.

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:33.660
Are you saying that he's not actually on the crew of a
space battleship?! What about the squid fishing?!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:33.700
Squid
Fishing...

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.620
What I want to know is why you never doubted it!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.290
Even the nuclear-powered submersible aircraft carrier?!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:39.410
Even if it did exist, they wouldn't use it to fish for squid!

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:42.000
It seems likely that your mother is the key to all of this.

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:43.500
My mom is?

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:44.410
Momo?!

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:45.120
Mikan...?

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:46.750
It looks like she's having a terrible nightmare!

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:47.910
Hey, are you okay?

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.200
Her timing couldn't be any worse...

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:53.950
I'm a little busy inside of my dream right now,
so don't wake me up.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.700
But I'm worried because your face looks incredibly pale!

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.750
And also, Metako ate something weird
off the carpet that I couldn't identify!

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:03.000
Wake up! Wake up! Wake up! I'm starting to panic!

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.160
Nice timing on that friendly fire, Mikan!

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:09.660
Is the dream world just going to fall apart like this?

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:10.330
Shamiko!

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:10.910
Huh?

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:14.040
I get the feeling that there's some
secret hidden in your house!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.750
I'm going to head there as soon as I wake up!

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.950
You need to start being more upfront about everything!

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:22.330
Your family... specifically your mom...
you should grill her...!

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:23.330
"Grill"...?

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:31.410
Oh, Momo! You finally woke up! Are you okay?

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:34.540
Hinatsuki Brand
Mikan Buns

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:33.620
Would you like some mikan flavored buns?

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:34.540
Huh?

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:35.450
Mikan...

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:38.950
I completely understand that you shook me awake
because you thought it was for the best.

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:40.200
But it backfired.

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:42.580
What? Did I screw up something important again?!

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:45.120
Yuko! It's already noon!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:48.620
Huh? What was I just doing?

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:51.580
I remember diving into Momo's dream
and then getting captured...

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:55.040
Your mother... needs to be grilled!

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:56.790
I'm coming to your house!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:59.700
Grilled... grilled... She's gonna eat her?!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.080
GRILL
(TO COOK)

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:01.080
She needs to be grilled!

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.370
Did you sleep in because you feel sick?

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:04.660
Mom! Ouch!

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:07.370
That Magical Girl I mentioned before
is coming here right now!

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:08.660
Oh dear, really?

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:11.500
The only drink we have available is barley tea
that I just started to steep, so it still looks like water.

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:14.370
That's not the problem! She's coming here to grill you!

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:15.200
You have to hide!

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:15.950
Yuko?

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.500
Crisis Management Form!

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:23.660
Shamiko.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:24.540
Momo...

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.540
P-please just leave us alone.

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:29.450
Why did you transform? Are you actually an exhibitionist?

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:32.250
Look, I know that you're here to go after my mom!

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:34.120
GRILL
(TO COOK)

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:34.080
You said you were going to grill her!

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:37.700
Yeah, I really think you should give her a good grilling.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.870
GRILL
(TO QUESTION)

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:38.870
You're her daughter, after all.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:47.750
Tremble
Tremble
Tremble
Tremble

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.790
Do children normally ever want to... grill their parents?

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:47.750
GRILL
(TO EAT)

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.410
Why do you seem so scared by the idea?

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:47.750
TREMBLE

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:45.910
Who wouldn't be absolutely terrified by the thought of it?!

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:47.700
My mom isn't a bad person!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:50.790
Even if she's not bad,
we know that she's hiding something.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:52.750
And that's enough of a reason to grill her?!

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:58.700
GRILL
(TO EAT)

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:52.580
EEEEK!

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:54.080
You're better off doing it than not.

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:56.910
I know you're not good at holding people's feet
to the fire, Shamiko. So I'll help you out with this one.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:58.750
You're really serious about
making this happen, aren't you?!

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:01.910
Hey girls, I get the feeling
that neither of you is on the same page here.

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:04.000
Scuttle, scuttle.
SHUDDER...

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:08.410
SPARKLE

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:08.410
ANCESTOOOOOOR!

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:11.160
Oh God, my body just threw Ms. Lilith totally on instinct!

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:13.370
My power to dive into her dreams
ended up working in a weird way!

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:15.450
Shamiko... let me through.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.410
Absolutely not!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.540
I'm doing this because I'm worried about you, Shamiko!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.080
Yoshida

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:21.120
Oh, in times like these...

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:26.290
From now on, I think I can overcome any mountains that
get in my way by just remembering this okonomiyaki!

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:28.660
Yeah, okonomiyaki!

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:29.870
Huh?

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:32.500
The very first time I came to your house with food...

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:36.830
...all of the food that you thought was delicious
is something that my mom taught me how to make.

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:40.410
I don't care if she keeps secrets
and no matter how illogical it may be,

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:45.500
I want to protect my mom, Ryo, and this house
that my father will someday come back to!

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:48.790
Magical Girl, Momo Chiyoda!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:52.120
If you want to get into this house,
then you're going to have to defeat me to do it!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.660
You've been misunderstanding each other
this whole time and I can't stand it anymore!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.160
We'll continue this chat once you come inside!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:03.910
Mom?!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:08.830
Yuko has always been frail and for a long time,
she was educated inside the hospital.

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:11.540
This is the first time she's ever brought a friend home.

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:13.500
She's not my friend, she's my mortal enemy!

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:16.080
I have a lot of things I would like to ask you.

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:17.950
Yes, I'm sure that you do.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:21.330
Yuko is a much stronger girl than I ever imagined.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:23.660
I know that I have to tell her the truth.

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:25.870
Though there are many things that I find difficult to say.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.160
For starters, Yuko...

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:31.830
I think you should avoid wearing that outfit
you had on earlier outside from now on.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:33.000
You'll catch a cold.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:35.620
Please direct your complaints about that to our ancestor!

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:38.660
Now then... where should I start?

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.950
When Yuko was very little,
my husband and I moved to this city.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:49.660
The Magical Girl in charge of the city helped us
secure this apartment guarded by the barrier.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:49.870
BANDA TERRACE

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:53.330
The situation for Demons back then
was much more brutal than it is now.

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:55.450
Yes, I knew about all of that already.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:18:01.040
The Demons in this city are all protected by a barrier
that was set up by the Magical Girl before me.

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:04.500
Oh! Was she a girl named Sakura Chiyoda?

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:07.000
How do you know that name, Shamiko?

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.580
I heard it from a super muscular Metako
in your dream earlier!

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.700
Super muscular?

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:15.830
The Magical Girl known as Sakura Chiyoda
was both my teacher and sister-in-law.

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:16.830
Your sister?

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:20.290
Yes... and she went missing over 10 years ago.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:24.790
Miss Seiko, please tell me everything you know
about what happened back then.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:28.450
Your family and Shamiko have been
the only lead I’ve found in all those years.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:32.580
Sure, I’ll explain everything to you
in the order that it happened.

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:36.540
Yuko was born with an incredibly frail body
and terrible luck.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:40.790
It’s possible that Yuko inherited
most of the demon blood in the family,

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:43.830
and thereby suffered more from the effects of the curse.

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:49.660
In fact, her younger sister Ryoko
hardly seems to be affected by the seal at all.

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:53.540
It’s true that compared to Ryo,
Shamiko is pretty much a waste of space.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:56.200
So, all of her natural talent
has just been drained by the seal.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.620
Momo! What happened to you phrasing things nicely?!

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:03.620
Not quite! Personally speaking, I think part of it
is that she’s grown to take after her mother.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:06.410
To be honest, I was very klutzy before I got married!

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:07.500
Tee-hee
Tee-hee

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.120
Please don’t crush my hopes and dreams, mom!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.950
Seiiki
Memorial Hospital

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:12.500
Thanks to the continued efforts
of my husband and Ms. Sakura,

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:15.790
Yuko was ultimately saved and her health improved.

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:19.250
Back when we first came to this city,
I was pregnant with Ryoko.

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:24.080
Yuko was in very poor condition
and got placed in the same hospital that I was.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:29.330
My husband went to meet with Ms. Sakura,
thinking that she could help Yuko somehow.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:32.250
Apparently, she agreed to interfere
with the curse placed upon our family.

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:33.750
So, my sister...

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:44.080
Dogs
Lottery Luck
Traffic
Sports
Economic Fortune
Health

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:36.290
Ms. Sakura wracked her brains to find a way,

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:40.200
and managed to swap our family’s remaining economic
fortune for an increased blessing of Yuko’s health.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:43.950
Somehow, she rebalanced all of the resources
that fate left us so we could survive, which resulted in...

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:46.950
...the "$400 Per Month" curse falling upon us!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.580
So that’s why the curse is set at a rate
that matches the modern era!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:57.040
So basically, Momo’s sister messed with the curse
upon me and that’s why I ended up becoming healthy?

00:19:57.040 --> 00:20:01.200
It didn’t fix everything though, which is why
you stayed in the hospital for a while afterwards.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:04.540
My sister was extremely proficient
when it came to manipulating magic.

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:08.750
But I think that interfering in an ancient seal
would be difficult even for her.

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.750
That was what I heard.

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:15.330
The cost for countering a multilayered seal
from ancient times was very heavy.

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:20.830
From what I heard it soon became difficult for
Ms. Sakura to protect the city due to the loss of magic.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:26.500
That’s why my husband struck a deal and ultimately
ended up cooperating with her to keep the city safe.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:30.330
Um, so is there any truth to Shamiko’s father
being away from home for work?

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:32.450
I suppose I should explain.

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:35.950
I think it’s time for me to come clean
with Yuko about everything.

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:36.830
Huh?

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:39.410
After it became clear
that Yuko would be able to live her life...

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:42.700
...my husband was sealed away by Ms. Sakura.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:43.620
What?

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.910
The truth is that he is sealed
within this mikan box, at this very moment.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.120
Huh?

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:51.410
Your father...

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:53.000
...is in a sealed space...

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.580
...within this mikan box!

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:57.160
WHAAAAAT?!

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:57.160
BANDA TERRACE

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:59.700
But why?! How did things end up like this?!

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:03.660
I was in the hospital at the time so unfortunately,
I don’t know all the details of what happened.

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:06.620
MIKAN

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:07.450
After Yuko and Ryoko were both in good shape,
I took them back home with me and...

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:10.080
I'm sorry.
While I was protecting the city,
Mr. Joshua got caught up and ended up
being sealed away in this box.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:10.290
...I found this box placed next to our door
along with a handwritten note.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.330
My sister... just left this box...

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:17.700
...I mean, Mr. Box, alone with you and your two kids
before she up and disappeared. Is that right?

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:20.250
You don’t have to call him "Mr."

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:24.540
We’ve put really hot plates and bowls
right on top of this box, you know?

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:26.660
And even used it to reach things that were too high up!

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:29.830
This box is covered in a magic coating
that makes it incredibly tough!

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:33.200
It’s resistant to heat, oil, and even heavy impacts!

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:32.620
Oops, I dropped it!

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:35.290
That reminds me, I tripped over it earlier!

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:37.500
That is everything I know about what happened.

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:38.660
I understand.

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:44.160
Regardless of how it happened, my sister stole away
the father of this family for over 10 years.

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:48.120
And I never had even the slightest idea, this whole time.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:54.620
But Ms. Sakura made such great efforts to help us,
even though we were total strangers to her.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.700
Please... give me some time to think all of this over.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.080
Momo?

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:04.330
It seems... I really was your mortal enemy
this whole time.

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:06.910
I’m going home now.

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:07.870
Momo!

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:14.500
Momo...

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:34.040
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:41.250
Sassouto shobu shite

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:42.790
Yatchau kedo makechatte

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:44.000
Fugainai nai ne

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:45.540
Shoushin tenshin

00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:46.950
Kibun wa sunsun demo

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:48.620
Shippo de henji shiyou

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:52.410
Chounai de waiwai shite

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:54.000
Inu made bow-wow de

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:55.290
Tende meimei de

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:56.750
Shunka shuutou

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:00.040
Shippai shita tte waraitobasou

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:06.540
Ano koro to onaji you ni kokoro tsumuide

00:23:06.950 --> 00:23:12.370
Kono machi de deaeta kiseki

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.120
Kanaete yo

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:21.910
Zenkai da wa tire shou ippai

00:23:21.910 --> 00:23:24.700
Warning mada kikikanri enjoy

00:23:24.700 --> 00:23:30.250
Toridori saita iro canvas kakenuke

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:33.120
Sunset da wa, kangaete bakari ja

00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:35.370
Sou, mae!

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:40.120
Hora, donna iro datte yume kasanete

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:41.910
Motto asobou ne

00:23:51.000 --> 00:24:06.040
Preview

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:53.160
I’m going to chase after Momo!

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:56.750
You need to become strong in order to protect yourself
if you want to pave a path into the future.

00:23:55.330 --> 00:23:56.750
You’re my descendant and you have the ability

00:23:56.750 --> 00:23:59.450
to get into people’s hearts and freely manipulate them.

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:01.580
Why won’t you just rely on me, Momo?
I thought we were friends.

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:04.200
I’m also Momo’s friend, I mean her mortal enemy,

00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:06.040
Feelings to Convey!! A New Leap Forward for Demonkind!!

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:06.040
so I have the responsibility to go and find her!
